    "Copy the Client ID and the Secret into the two fields here, then press Connect.": "Copieu l'identificador de client i el secret als dos camps d'aquí i, a continuació, premeu Connect.",
    "Atlassian scopes its MCP to one site, so an account with no site — or one that is not an admin of it — is refused after signing in.": "Atlassian abasta el seu MCP a un lloc, de manera que un compte sense lloc (o un que no n'és un administrador) es rebutja després d'iniciar la sessió.",
    "Open https://www.figma.com/developers/mcp and sign in.": "Obriu https://www.figma.com/developers/mcp i inicieu la sessió.",
    "Press Enable or Create a client to generate a client for your account.": "Premeu Habilita o Crea un client per generar un client per al vostre compte.",
    "Register http://127.0.0.1:19876/oauth/callback as its callback URL if the form asks for one.": "Registreu http://127.0.0.1:19876/oauth/callback com a URL de retorn de trucada si el formulari en demana.",
    "Copy the Client ID into the field here and press Connect.": "Copieu l'identificador de client al camp aquí i premeu Connect.",
