    "Press Create New Application, name it, set the callback to http://127.0.0.1:19876/oauth/callback, and copy the Client ID and Secret.": "按建立新應用程序，為其命名，將回調設定為 http://127.0.0.1:19876/oauth/callback，然後複製客戶端 ID 和金鑰。",
    "Add the scopes listed below under Scopes.": "在“範圍”下新增下面列出的範圍。",
