    "Open https://dashboard.render.com and sign in.": "Bude https://dashboard.render.com kuma shiga.",
    "Open Settings → API Keys, then Create Key if you have none.": "Bude Saituna → Maɓallan API, sannan Ƙirƙiri Maɓalli idan ba ku da ko ɗaya.",
