    "Press Connect, approve the app in HubSpot, and it is done.": "Danna Connect, amince da ƙa'idar a HubSpot, kuma an gama.",
    "Served by iFillPDF, not Adobe. Its sign-in document points at a hosted identity provider and registers clients itself, so nothing has to be filled in.": "iFillPDF ne ke aiki, ba Adobe ba. Abubuwan daftarin shigarwar sa a wurin mai ba da shaida da aka shirya kuma yana yin rajistar abokan ciniki da kanta, don haka babu abin da za a cika ciki.",
    "Apify also accepts a personal API token in the Authorization header, but its sign-in document registers clients for us, so the browser route is the shorter one.": "Apify kuma yana karɓar alamar API na sirri a cikin taken izini, amma takardar sa-hannun shiga tana yiwa abokan ciniki rajista, don haka hanyar mai binciken ita ce mafi guntu.",
